    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a grim world where reality intertwines with nightmare, you are the last surviving guardian, armed with a legendary bat\u2014an ancient artifact of unimaginable power. Every step is a fight for survival in a distorted realm filled with mutations, ghosts, and monsters eager to destroy you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bat of Dead is a brutal adventure where:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every enemy is a deadly threat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The landscape constantly shifts and betrays you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The artifact in your hands is your only chance of salvation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reality crumbles into fragments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sounds of chaos and pain haunt your every move</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your bat as a weapon, shield, and guide between worlds. Solve insane puzzles, battle unimaginable creatures, and try to maintain your sanity in this nightmarish journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you survive? Bat of Dead awaits its hero.</p>",
